            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nThis was already discussed in several issues, for example #1293. The reason is that built-in `t` surrounding is the whole `<tag ...>` and `</tag>` pair. If you want a \"tag *name*\" surrounding, the suggestion is to create custom surroundings like described in [this comment](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1293#issuecomment-2423827325).",
